00:35:38.560 --> 00:35:41.080
we use the little lipstick cameras inside the car.

821
00:35:41.360 --> 00:35:41.520
Yeah.

822
00:35:41.860 --> 00:35:44.040
There is a real degrade in quality.

823
00:35:44.420 --> 00:35:49.040
Like if you see us in the office and then it cuts to people in the car, I didn't really

