00:36:05.080 --> 00:36:10.220
And Dave said that the lipstick cameras that we use in the cars shooting The Office, they

831
00:36:10.220 --> 00:36:14.580
did not have the same quality of resolution or lenses that our regular cameras had.

832
00:36:14.820 --> 00:36:18.120
